9690659\" width=800 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're trapped in eternal limbo with many others. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no authority to judge you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is Hell... broken?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775260/extras/7662ce4675379126f53f365ee845ac4c.avif?t=1779690659\" width=800 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with the <strong>Renegade</strong> and reveal his story to unlock the <strong>Witch</strong> and the <strong>Oathbreaker</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>Story interactables</strong> to learn more about how their past binds them, and unravel their intertwined fates. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the knowledge to challenge your &quot;holier-than-thou&quot; guide in the lantern, and reveal the true nature of their plight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775260/extras/671d3db6b0a548f5556cfa5957266f5b.poster.avif?t=1779690659\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775260/extras/671d3db6b0a548f5556cfa5957266f5b.webm?t=1779690659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775260/extras/671d3db6b0a548f5556cfa5957266f5b.mp4?t=1779690659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775260/extras/afddff6929ea3523f9ebdce7d188b070.avif?t=1779690659\" width=800 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the initial three biomes - the <strong>Wither</strong>, the <strong>Haunt</strong> and the <strong>Slough</strong> - and contact lost souls to open the way to the deeper circles of Hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the three hidden Circles and vanquish the  <strong>Fallen</strong> to let them invade your future runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge them and restore their full power, for you will need their <strong>Boons</strong> to reach the final showdown at the seventh Circle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775260/extras/888b73035b30f43e9d0db43d6dc3adca.avif?t=1779690659\" width=800 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI was used in the making of this game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "Armed with curses and guided by a Saint, you bleed Light to escape Purgatory in this hack &amp; slash roguelite of non-linear progression where every interaction matters.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775260/adde15346fe66d3bf02fba428d6acf991481a616/header.jpg?t=1779690659", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775260/004feda6ad05b335066715fa9c955ce9f81ea436/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779690659", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775260/004feda6ad05b335066715fa9c955ce9f81ea436/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779690659", "website": "https://linktr.ee/borrowed_light", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li>